Changes:
 wayexpand (1.2.0-1) focal; urgency=high
 .
   * Backend & keyboard correctness: fix child process cleanup on all error paths
   * Fix libei token persistence configuration for input-method systemd service
   * Make libei key pass-through optional and non-blocking during startup
   * Add 9 new pass-through regression tests and bounded queue implementation
   * Fix external editor integration for commands with arguments (e.g., code --wait)
   * Resolve documentation contradictions about experimental key pass-through
   * Reorder release workflow for accurate SBOM generation from artifacts
   * Delete divergent v1.2 tag to restore release history consistency
   * All 330+ unit tests passing with comprehensive test coverage
